  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1103.09 Other Required Information for Designated Beach or Flow-through Bathing Place Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1103.09 Other Required Information for Designated Beach or Flow-through Bathing Place Application. The information required by Env-Wq 1103.02(c)(2) shall be as follows:\n\n(a) The location of the nearest toilet facilities per Env-Wq 1108.04, if any;\n\n(b) Information on the water quality for the swimming area, including a copy of a recent bacterial analysis and the location of any water inlets, point discharges, and non-point sources of pollution; and\n\n(c) Information on the height, location, and material of the security fencing, if any.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100) #8468, eff 11-1-05; ss by #10577, eff 5-1-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100); ss by #13198, eff 5-1-21 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100)",
